{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Pascal's Requiem soundtrack, produced and composed by Nicholas O\u2019Brien, aims to capture the late 90\u2019s aesthetic through its use of sound design and samples that were common during the 32 bit console era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music is inspired by the great JRPG series during the N64 and PS1 generation of games; by focusing on traditional orchestration, the composer captures the familiar atmosphere that this generation of games are known for. The emotional range of the soundtrack serves to reinforce the air of adventure, thrill, and foreboding that the story of Pascal\u2019s Requiem offers to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The OST features 24 songs, available in both WAV and MP3 formats, and has an approximate runtime of 38 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609270?t=1747838544","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609270?t=1747838544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609270/56781cca8d69bc8ca8074387efe4d6527d3d76b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747838544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609270/56781cca8d69bc8ca8074387efe4d6527d3d76b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747838544","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Pascal's Requiem soundtrack, produced and composed by Nicholas O\u2019Brien, aims to capture the late 90\u2019s aesthetic through its use of sound design and samples that were common during the 32 bit console era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music is inspired by the great JRPG series during the N64 and PS1 generation of games; by focusing on traditional orchestration, the composer captures the familiar atmosphere that this generation of games are 